      "note": "The module-boundary fixture resets the worktree service holder as well as the closed mutable-state register, before the module and in its `finally` cleanup. The holder is one object rather than a module-level collection the syntactic scanner discovers; an earlier module's server supplier cannot serve the next module's worktree operation.\n\nAnchor: `reset_process_state_at_module_boundaries`",
